{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12996","headline":"九月九日李苏州东楼宴 · 独孤及","name":"九月九日李苏州东楼宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"是菊花开日，当君乘兴秋。\n风前孟嘉帽，月下庾公楼。\n酒解留征客，歌能破别愁。\n醉归无以赠，祗奉万年酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}